ober Next Fest! The full game will follow soon after and will include 20 levels, 14 different ball types, achievements, additional character work, and more! Plink Lab is currently sitting at 4,000 wishlists which is amazing! I'd like ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:02:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689914","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4614970-1844115010500520","game_id":"steam-4614970","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update & 3,500 Wishlists!","summary":"I am happy to announce the next update to the demo is now available!Allow me to start by saying thank you to the over 3,500 people that have wishlisted Plink Lab already! I am so grateful to see so many people interested in playing my plinko game. 🙏🙏I have received a lot of feedback from players that have played the demo so far and have been working hard on implementing improvements to the game.Please find the most important changes below:New title screen. Continue or start a new game, with pegs","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T06:52:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010500520","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4614970-1840944183785290","game_id":"steam-4614970","kind":"announcement","title":"📢 Plink Lab Demo is Now Live! Experience the All-New Art Upgrade!","summary":"Plink Lab Demo is Officially Open! Hello everyone! I am thrilled to announce that the Demo for Plink Lab is officially live! You can head over to the store page right now, download it, and start your brand-new journey to unimaginable wealth! During the recent Playtest phase, I received a massive amount of incredibly meaningful 